OL,3,GNEWSAMet Police investigate several
OL,4,Areports on Russell Brand following his
OL,5,Aconviction
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe officer who led the investigation
OL,8,Finto Russell Brand has said that the
OL,9,FMetropolitan Police have received
OL,10,F"several reports during the trial and
OL,11,Fsince the trial" following the
OL,12,Fdisgraced comedian's conviction and
OL,13,Fsentence.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
