OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMet Police investigate several
OL,4,Areports on Russell Brand following his
OL,5,Aconviction
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpeaking to BBC Breakfast on Tuesday,
OL,8,FDet Supt Andy Furphy said that officers
OL,9,Fwere in the "process of triaging" those
OL,10,Freports and were "looking at exactly
OL,11,Fwhat we've got, whether they're
OL,12,Finformation that points to behaviour or
OL,13,Fwhether they could constitute a
OL,14,Fcriminal offence, so our work isn't
OL,15,Fdone."
OL,17,FBrand is already being investigated
OL,18,Fover rape allegations from two more
OL,19,Fwomen. He has been interviewed under
OL,20,Fcaution in connection to those
OL,21,Fallegations.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
